  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/658/658-10.htm",
  "statuteText": "658:10 In Towns. –\n\nIf any town shall so vote, the selectmen shall provide one or more additional polling places in such town and shall, at least 30 days before the next following general election, determine the boundaries of the voting district to be served by each such additional polling place."
}
